{"rpid": "1038845586", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "洗鸭不怕开水烫", "mid": "32156696", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "Tell me now, pretty baby\nYou could never stop unaware\nToo gone, for don't you get it now?\n\n\nDo you know that I'm feeling down?\nEvery love went through your head\nGiving love turned bad\nMaybe love can soothe your pains\nMaking up, make it better\nUp Ladybug, never doubt, ‘til we find one way, forever\nUp Ladybug, got a goal, we'll be fine some day, together\nDid you know it couldn't be enough?\n‘Cause I need what's stolen away\nTaking all that to a better love\nWhen you need it all the way\nWhen you're going through your head\nGiving love turned bad\nAnd a love can steal your pains\nMaking up, make it better\nUp Ladybug, never doubt, ‘til we find one way, forever\nUp Ladybug, got a goal, we'll be fine some day, together\nUp Ladybug, never doubt, ‘til we find one way, forever\nUp Ladybug, got a goal, we'll be fine some day, together\n翻译往下。。。。。。", "like": 14, "ctime": 1535594652, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "373041", "video_bvid": "BV1zx411F7Sv", "video_title": "东映X法国Zagtoon「虫姬」PV", "video_desc": "BGM很不错 东映和法国Zagtoon动画联手制作的新美少女变身动画《虫姬》预告片", "video_owner": "小清水亜美", "video_view": 14523, "video_reply": 33, "video_n1": 22, "video_n2": 11}
{"rpid": "1038823761", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "洗鸭不怕开水烫", "mid": "32156696", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "告诉我，漂亮的宝贝\n\n你不可能不知道就停下来\n\n太遥远了，你现在还不明白吗?\n\n\n你知道我情绪低落吗?\n\n所有的爱都穿过你的脑海\n\n给爱转坏\n\n也许爱可以抚平你的伤痛\n\n弥补，让它变得更好\n\n走吧，瓢虫，不要怀疑，直到我们找到一条路，永远\n\n起来，瓢虫，有目标了，我们总有一天会好起来的\n\n你知道这还不够吗?\n\n因为我需要被偷走的东西\n\n带着所有这些去一个更好的爱\n\n当你需要它的时候\n\n当你在思考的时候\n\n给爱转坏\n\n爱可以偷走你的痛苦\n\n弥补，让它变得更好\n\n走吧，瓢虫，不要怀疑，直到我们找到一条路，永远\n\n起来，瓢虫，有目标了，我们总有一天会好起来的\n\n走吧，瓢虫，不要怀疑，直到我们找到一条路，永远\n\n起来，瓢虫，有目标了，我们总有一天会好起来的", "like": 26, "ctime": 1535594554, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "373041", "video_bvid": "BV1zx411F7Sv", "video_title": "东映X法国Zagtoon「虫姬」PV", "video_desc": "BGM很不错 东映和法国Zagtoon动画联手制作的新美少女变身动画《虫姬》预告片", "video_owner": "小清水亜美", "video_view": 14523, "video_reply": 33, "video_n1": 22, "video_n2": 11}
